        <mxCell id="notes" value="Notes:&#xa;1. PUL+ / DIR+ / ENA+ are fed from 5V through 330-470Ω.&#xa;2. Transistor emitter goes to GND, collector goes to PUL- / DIR- / ENA-.&#xa;3. GPIO HIGH drives base current through 2.2kΩ and turns the transistor on.&#xa;4. ENA is optional for first tests.&#xa;5. Do not connect 5V directly to XIAO GPIO." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
